---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>网站维护 · He Shan</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}admin/dashboard.css`}/></head>
  <body>
    <main id="login-panel" class="login-panel">
      <a class="brand" href={base}>HE SHAN <span>网站维护</span></a>
      <h1>管理员登录</h1><p>登录后管理网站内容、论文分类与摘要图。</p>
      <form id="login-form"><label>账号<input name="username" value="admin" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="64"/></label><label>密码<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="256"/></label><button type="submit">登录后台</button></form>
      <p id="login-message" role="status"></p><a href={base}>返回网站</a>
    </main>
    <div id="workspace" hidden>
      <header><a class="brand" href={base} target="_blank" rel="noopener">HE SHAN <span>网站维护</span></a><span id="save-status" role="status"></span><button id="logout" class="secondary">退出登录</button></header>
      <div class="layout"><nav id="navigation" aria-label="维护栏目"></nav><main class="content"><section id="overview"><h1>维护总览</h1><p>统一管理站点资料和各栏目。保存后自动发布；论文的人工分类、作者与摘要图会优先保留。</p><div id="stats" class="stats"></div><div class="toolbar"><label>搜索论文<input id="paper-search" type="search" placeholder="题名、作者、DOI"/></label><label>范围<select id="paper-filter"><option value="all">全部论文</option><option value="pending">自动新增 · 待核对</option><option value="identity">身份待核实</option></select></label></div><div id="papers"></div></section><iframe id="editor" title="内容编辑窗口" hidden></iframe></main></div>
    </div>
    <script is:inline src={`${base}admin/dashboard.js`}></script>
  </body>
</html>
